        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Zurek is Poland's most distinctive soup. The sour, creamy broth with crisp bacon and a hard-boiled egg is a combination unlike anything else. This version gets its sourness from white wine vinegar -- straightforward and reliable." }]
